2026-05-09 19:23:54,171 - INFO - - Are influenced by external factors like upbringing, health, and test anxiety, rather than pure "innate" ability.
2026-05-09 19:23:54,171 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 19:23:54,171 - INFO - Overall, IQ tests aren't meaningless—they provide useful insights into cognitive strengths—but they're just one tool and shouldn't be overemphasized. To resolve your argument, you might agree that while IQ tests measure *something* valuable, they're not the definitive word on intelligence. Suggest exploring other measures, like EQ (emotional quotient) tests, for a fuller picture!
